OL,5,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FA&E staff treat a patient with
OL,7,     Fburns who also shows signs of a
OL,8,     Fpossible stroke, and a
OL,9,     Fmotorcyclist is brought into resus
OL,10,     Fwith after being hit from behind.
OL,11,G2200 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,12,     FHigh-octane medical emergencies
OL,13,     Finclude a man found collapsed in a
OL,14,     Fhotel room, a head-on collision
OL,15,     Fbetween two motorcyclists, and an
OL,16,     F11-year-old who's taken a tumble
OL,17,     Ffrom his scooter.
